      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oh, you're playing on desktop mode on a PC and you're using a mouse. So when you click on the mouse to do something in the expression menu the world also gets the interaction event.\n\nVRChat has a few different ways to play, so looking at the video, the fact that you're using a mouse needs to be in your post. I'd also mention that you're playing on desktop, just to be nice to anyone triaging bugs.\n\nSuggested fix: suppress mouse click events to world/udon when expression wheel is open",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
