  "details": "Look at any UX from any world, open your expression menu and click on any of your buttons while looking at the UX.\n\nExample: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pPuy43gX2TU\n\nI've click on stuff I didn't mean to, all the time, especially since it works through users. I've started Murder matches before while clicking through my expression menu.",
